WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Open FortiX API Studio to build and test a self-contained REST API without external services.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
Click Create Products API (100 Records) to generate typed schemas, sample data, and a gateway route.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
Use the interactive Playground to send live GET, POST, PATCH, and DELETE requests through the proxy.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
Inspect HTTP status codes, round-trip latency, X-Request-ID, and rate-limit headers in real time.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
Trigger a 20x burst test or export the OpenAPI 3.1 contract, then prove controls in Verifications.
